# Mass of Darkness (Q166): a dark elven fighter of level 10 accepts at Undrias with his letter;
# Iria gives the ceremonial dagger and has nothing more when asked again, Dorankus the dreviant
# wine, and Trudy the scripture, which moves the cond; Undrias takes the three and his letter
# for adena and experience; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this
# scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q166_mass_of_darkness.golden
character Acolyte 10
class 31
script quest.Q166_MassOfDarkness
item 1088 1089 1090 1091 57
